{"unit":6,"items":21,"pass":15,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 6","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 6 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Food</h2>\n      <p>Twenty-one questions on Lessons 21&ndash;24: some/any, quantities, eating out. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>15 out of 21</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u6\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar and vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;15</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the correct answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">There is ___ milk in the fridge.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">any</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">some</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">many</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">We don't have ___ eggs.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">some</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">any</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">___ there any bread? — No.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Are</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">How ___ eggs do we need?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">many</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">often</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">much</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">How ___ milk is there?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">often</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">many</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">much</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">There is too ___ salt in the soup.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">many</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">much</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">enough</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">We don't have ___ chairs for everyone.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">enough</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">many</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">too</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">The small dish before the main course is a ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">starter</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">dessert</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">bill</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">The sweet dish at the end is the ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">side dish</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">dessert</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">starter</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">Chicken cooked over fire is ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">fresh</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">boiled</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">grilled</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\">Would you like ___ to drink?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a thing</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">any</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">something</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\">I'___ like the fish, please.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">m</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">d</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">s</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">Could I ___ the menu, please?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">have</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">to have</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">having</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">At the end you ask for the ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">bill</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">paper</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">list</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">Water with bubbles is ___ water.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">still</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">fresh</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">sparkling</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Write the answer &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 16&ndash;21</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Type your answer. Spelling counts; capital letters and full stops do not.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">Make it negative: There is some bread.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"There isn't any bread.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Make a question: We have some rice.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Do we have any rice?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">Say there is too much of it: salt<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"There is too much salt.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">Order politely: the chicken<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Could I have the chicken, please?|I'd like the chicken, please.|Can I have the chicken, please?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">Ask for the bill politely.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Could we have the bill, please?|Can we have the bill, please?|Could I have the bill, please?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: How much eggs do we need?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"How many eggs do we need?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}